1
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:42,260
That little one looks tender.

2
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,600
Must be delicious.

3
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:44,960
Go report to the Chief.

4
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:47,060
Tell him lunch is sorted for today.

5
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:47,900
Delicious?

6
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:49,460
Lunch?

7
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:51,090
How can they eat people?

8
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:53,600
They are demons,

9
00:00:53,930 --> 00:00:55,860
and they cultivate the physical body.

10
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:57,500
Eating humans is cultivation

11
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,230
to them.

12
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:02,060
I already know.

13
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,129
But these people look extraordinary.

14
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:08,000
They are not something you can just eat.

15
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:15,360
You trespassed into
my Black Wind Stronghold.

16
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:16,890
What is your business here?

17
00:01:17,030 --> 00:01:18,560
You must be Hei Wuya.

18
00:01:18,730 --> 00:01:20,130
Hand over the Black Holy Crystal,

19
00:01:20,130 --> 00:01:21,730
and we will spare your lives.

20
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:23,660
Hahaha.

21
00:01:23,930 --> 00:01:25,360
You want the Black Holy Crystal?

22
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:27,100
Let's see if you have what it takes.

23
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:27,560
A'kong,

24
00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:33,660
do I have to make a move again?

25
00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:35,259
You sent such a little thing?

26
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:36,530
Brothers, attack!

27
00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:49,430
No.

28
00:01:49,930 --> 00:01:50,990
Just a little more.

29
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,600
She needs pressure.

30
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,730
My Lady is using...

31
00:02:07,730 --> 00:02:08,660
my moves.

32
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,560
And such strong spiritual power.

33
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,130
She copied Feng's moves.

34
00:02:12,730 --> 00:02:14,130
If it is the power of Nuwa,

35
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:15,500
there should be a distance limit

36
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:16,960
from the one being copied.

37
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:19,000
As long as Feng is far enough away,

38
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,329
her copying will fail.

39
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:22,130
Feng,

40
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:24,590
go take out those archers outside.

41
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:25,700
Yes, sir.

42
00:02:34,829 --> 00:02:35,630
What is going on?

43
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:36,890
My spiritual power...

44
00:02:37,060 --> 00:02:37,860
Ah!

45
00:02:38,430 --> 00:02:40,960
Never mind, saving my life
is more important.

46
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:51,890
Chief, those archers
have been taken care of.

47
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:54,800
M-My Lady...

48
00:03:08,330 --> 00:03:10,000
If the power of Nuwa inside her

49
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,860
cannot be awakened on its own,

50
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,860
it will become her death warrant.

51
00:03:17,230 --> 00:03:18,630
Only a desperate situation

52
00:03:18,630 --> 00:03:20,060
can awaken her.

53
00:03:20,329 --> 00:03:22,400
Otherwise, she will forever
be just a shell

54
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,060
controlled by power.

55
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:26,060
Stand up, A'kong.

56
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,360
He doesn't believe me,

57
00:03:28,860 --> 00:03:30,860
so he wants these people to kill me.

58
00:03:32,060 --> 00:03:33,100
Why?

59
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:34,660
Why can he

60
00:03:34,660 --> 00:03:36,520
control my life and death at will?

61
00:03:37,260 --> 00:03:38,730
You want to see me die,

62
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,130
but I refuse to.

63
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:49,160
My life is my own.

64
00:03:49,630 --> 00:03:51,230
W-What is that?

65
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:57,630
Survive.

66
00:04:04,660 --> 00:04:05,860
How is this possible?

67
00:04:05,860 --> 00:04:07,430
She didn't die from such injuries.

68
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:08,800
Is she even human?

69
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,460
Are you satisfied, sir?

70
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:14,560
If you wanted to kill me,
why go to such lengths?

71
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:25,800
Chief,

72
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:26,760
My Lady...

73
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,600
Hand over the Black Holy Crystal.

74
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,630
H-Here you go.

75
00:04:38,930 --> 00:04:39,600
Chief,

76
00:04:39,830 --> 00:04:42,560
is this stone really
more important than My Lady?

77
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,130
This is my mother's relic.

78
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,730
It went missing after she died.

79
00:04:51,430 --> 00:04:53,830
I only found its whereabouts
a century ago.

80
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:56,730
But My Lady...

81
00:04:58,230 --> 00:05:00,130
We walk different paths
from her after all.

82
00:05:00,130 --> 00:05:01,000
Let's continue our journey

83
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:01,800
to Qiong City.

84
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:07,200
Send someone to follow her.

85
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:07,800
In secret.

86
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,330
Do not let her notice.

87
00:05:17,530 --> 00:05:18,560
Where am I?

88
00:05:19,130 --> 00:05:19,860
The dungeon.

89
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:21,360
It's been two days.

90
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:23,760
You were heavily injured
and haven't had a drop of water,

91
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,090
yet you are still alive.

92
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:27,430
Oh no.

93
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:29,560
It's the survivor from that day.

94
00:05:29,730 --> 00:05:31,830
Hmph. It seems you still remember me.

95
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,760
I wanted to kill you right away,

96
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,560
but it's a pity
the Left Protector wants to see you.

97
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,430
Come with me.

98
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,690
Great job, Chilian.

99
00:05:39,730 --> 00:05:41,659
I need to find a way to escape first.

100
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:45,200
What are you muttering to yourself?

101
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:46,960
I told you to get up and come with me.

102
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,020
Didn't you hear me?

103
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:50,760
I heard you.

104
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:51,960
I am going.

105
00:05:57,930 --> 00:05:59,060
No one treated me.

106
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:00,600
How did my wounds heal?

107
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,860
Oh no, it's a dead end.

108
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:10,990
Your physical strength
is truly surprising.

109
00:06:18,860 --> 00:06:19,330
Oh no.

110
00:06:19,860 --> 00:06:20,600
Down there is...
